# Phase 4, GA-2-7's recheck (2026-10-14): the Budget page's Balance tile draws the absent glyph until a year has closed ("a dash before the
# first close", §220) - the running accumulator stood there, a figure no year computed - and the policy web's yield readout is floored at zero
# (GA-2-2's UI half, held from §815). The plan that found it, Tools/audit/area2b_presented.plan, unchanged, then area 2 as GA-2-2's recheck ran
# it (Tools/audit/p4_ga2_2.plan's runs, unchanged). Expected: in <id>_labels.tsv the Budget page's Balance tile on days 1 and 30 is the absent
# glyph with the slip "BALANCE, NO YEAR HAS CLOSED YET" (it printed -US$23.0M and -US$625M for Sweden), the closed year from day 366 as
# before; no breach, no error. A presentation change: against Tools/audit/p4_ga2_7_pre.plan (the presented plan on HEAD's two files, the same
# harness) the trajectories are byte-identical and the label tables differ on the Balance tile alone - the policy web is
# not a captured page (p4_ga22 ran before §816's and §817's baseline moves, so it is no twin).
